# The Syncfusion license key. Register one at
# https://www.syncfusion.com/account/manage-license-keys and paste it below (without
# the angle brackets). With no key the page shows the standard Syncfusion trial
# banner; with a valid key it does not.
#
# The legacy index.html hard-coded the key in source. The React port follows the
# factory baseline (factory/standards/app-source-baseline.md, "Syncfusion
# license") and reads it from the build environment instead.
VITE_SYNCFUSION_LICENSE_KEY=
